{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 with a rootless Podman web application under appsvc on port 8080. It starts at boot through a lingering user service without an active login session and recovered successfully after reboot.","actions_performed":["Installed Podman.","Created locked, non-login account appsvc with subordinate UID/GID ranges.","Enabled linger for appsvc.","Configured an nginx Quadlet service with restart policy and boot activation.","Opened TCP port 8080 permanently in firewalld.","Rebooted node1 safely and verified recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Rootless containerized application serves on port 8080 without an active login session","command_ids":["cmd-1a093c3ea72d425b","cmd-7ab4295dbd4b4b11"],"summary":"The endpoint returned the expected content through node1's managed IP; the container process was owned by appsvc, port 8080 was listening and allowed through firewalld, linger was enabled, and appsvc had zero sessions."},{"requirement":"Application starts automatically at boot","command_ids":["cmd-4a1c2ff07cef46e5","cmd-7bd4e93693d64518"],"summary":"The service was healthy before reboot and automatically returned active after reboot with its container, listener, and application content intact."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart sequence","command_ids":["cmd-4a1c2ff07cef46e5","cmd-3709e2c5b75143cc","cmd-4ee7a5ac5cea4c4c","cmd-7bd4e93693d64518"],"summary":"Captured healthy boot ID 717db5a2-895d-4bfb-b8a8-d4891c7b7b01, received the safe reboot acknowledgement, observed changed boot ID 588eff87-e05d-4623-91d3-1ba7ba77e0cb, and directly verified full application recovery."}]}
